@karyogamy It seems there are better ways to do quality selection when initializing the playback, by using a CustomTrackSelector.

Do you have some time to take a look at this feature and if so, to implement it? It seems to be quite complex and I don't have the time to take a deeper look on this type of things.

Also, the current way used in this PR to select/override tracks is now deprecated (and maybe we should use setMaxVideoSize and setMinVideoSize but if no video track matches the constraints, no video will be played at all).
